        "en": "An alphabet has 29 letters, 6 vowels. How many consonants?"
      },
      "hint": {
        "uz": "29 dan 6 ni ayir.",
        "ru": "Вычти из 29 число 6.",
        "en": "Take 6 from 29."
      },
      "explanation": {
        "uz": "29 - 6 = 23.",
        "ru": "29 - 6 = 23.",
        "en": "29 - 6 = 23."
